        "Eugene J. Mele",
        "Laurens W. Molenkamp"
      ],
      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "The quantum spin Hall effect and topological-insulator concept established a qualitatively new protected state of electronic matter.",
        "attribution": "Kane and Mele supplied the seminal theoretical prediction, and Molenkamp led landmark experimental realization.",
        "maturity": "The phenomena are firmly established and have seeded a major field of topological quantum matter.",
        "uncertainties": [
